{title: Ennai Kaanavillaye}
{artist: S P Balsubramaniam A R Rahman}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Anbae..        [Dm]Anbae.. [E]Anbae..
[Am]Enai Kaanavillaiyae Naetroadu,        [Am]Engum Thaedi Paarkkiraen Kaatroadu
[Am]Uyir Oadi Poanadhoa Unnoadu,        [Dm]Anbae.. [E]
[Am]Naan Nizhalillaadhavan Theriyaadhaa,        [Am]En Nizhalum Neeyena Puriyaadhaa
[Am]Udal Nizhalai Chaeravae Mudiyaadhaa,        [Dm]Anbae.. [E]Anbae
[Am]Nadai Poadum Poongaatrae Poongaatrae,        [Dm]vaa Vaa..En [E]Vaasaldhaan..
[Am]Vandhaal.. [Dm]Vazhvaenae [E]Naan,        [Am]Enai Kaanavillaiyae Naetroadu
[Am]Engum Thaedi Paarkkiraen Kaatroadu,        [Am]Uyir Oadi Poanadhoa Unnoadu
[Dm]Anbae.. [E],        [Dm]Aagaram Illaamal [Am]Naan Vaazha Kudum
[Dm]Anbae Un Paerai Cholli [Am]Thaan,        [Dm]Theek Kuchi Illamal [Am]Thi Mutta Kudum
[Dm]Kannae Nam Kangal Sandhi [Am]thaal,        [Dm]Naan Enru Sonnalae [Am]Naan Alla Nidhan
[Dm]Ni Inri Vaazhndhale [Am]Nirkuda Thidhan,        [Dm]Un Svaasak Kaatril [E]Vaazhvaen Naan
[Am]Enai Kaanavillaiyae Naetroadu,        [Am]Engum Thaedi Paarkkiraen Kaatroadu
[Am]Uyir Oadi Poanadhoa Unnoadu,        [Dm]Anbae.. [E]
[Dm]Nimishangal Ovvonrum [Am]Varushangalagum,        [Dm]Nee Ennai Neengi Chenraa [Am]lae
[Dm]Varushangal Ovvonrum [Am]Nimishangal Aagum,        [Dm]Nee Endhan Pakkam Ninraa [Am]lae
[Dm]Meyyaga Nee Ennai [Am]Virumbadha Poadhum,        [Dm]Poi Onru Sol Kannae [Am]En Jivan Vaazhum
[Dm]Nijam Undhan Kaadha [E]lenraal,        [Am]Enai Kaanavillaiyae Naetroadu
[Am]Engum Thaedi Paarkkiraen Kaatroadu,        [Am]Uyir Oadi Poanadhoa Unnoadu
[Dm]Anbae.. [E],        [Am]Naan Nizhalillaadhavan Theriyaadhaa
[Am]En Nizhalum Neeyena Puriyaadhaa,        [Am]Udal Nizhalai Chaeravae Mudiyaadhaa
[Dm]Anbae.. [E]Anbae
